chezmoi dots audit — Audit live shell configuration

USAGE
  chezmoi dots audit aliases

COMMANDS
  aliases    Detect unmanaged live shell aliases

ARGUMENTS
  aliases  Required audit command; there is no default audit.

OPTIONS
  -h, --help  Show this help and exit successfully.

ENVIRONMENT
  See aliases help for shell configuration locations.

EXAMPLES
  chezmoi dots audit aliases
  chezmoi dots help audit aliases
